## App management

Custom apps live in `apps/` in this repo (see `apps/README.md`).

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `dude app new --name my_app` | Scaffold a new app (`bench new-app`) and relocate it into `apps/` |
| `dude app install --name my_app` | Install an app from the bench onto the site |

---

## Testing

Tests use Frappe's `FrappeTestCase` (each test runs in a rolled-back
transaction) and run inside the bench via `bench run-tests`.

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `dude test` | Run the `ticketing` app's test suite |
| `dude test --app my_app` | Test a different app |
| `dude test --module ticketing.ticketing.doctype.ticket_escalation_rule.test_ticket_escalation_rule` | Run a single test module |

