## Deploy (infrastructure as code)

This project can provision AWS infrastructure (ECS Fargate) and release the
app with the `dude iac` command group. Every `iac` command is **scoped to one
environment via `--env <name>`, which is required** — run any `iac` command
without `--env` to list the environments discovered on disk.

The full runbook — bootstrap, provisioning, building and shipping images, and
teardown — lives on the **[Deploy (AWS ECS)](deploy.md)** page; the live
command list is in `dude help` (and the [Command reference](api.md)).
{{/if}}

